'''Alois''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 3.8 Update|Version 3.8]] and was created by a collaboration event between [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event|Merc Storia and Battle Cats]] and can be unlocked by rolling the [[Cat Capsule| Rare Cat Capsule]] during the event period.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 189
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Alois
|name2 = Alois CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Alois CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Alois does not fare well alongside more relevant crowd-controllers despite functioning okay in a vacuum. Many angels either have many knockbacks (like [[Angelic Gory]]) or outrange Alois (like [[Angelic Sleipnir|Angelic Slepnir]]), so Alois can only work effectively against bulky melee enemies such as [[Boraphim]] and [[Heavenly Hippoe]]. These kinds of enemies already have a strong counter, [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]]. On top of knockback being more supplementary crowd-control, especially at a somewhat low rate, Sanzo can stack and apply [[Slow|Slow]] (and [[Weaken|Weaken]] with [[Talents]]) much more often to impede foes. Alois could work, however, to occasionally reposition [[St. Dober]] so your Sanzo stack can continue stalling him, even though this is a very niche use. Still, Talented [[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fiend Cat]] does the same thing and more, with [[Knockback|Knockback]] at a higher frequency, pierce to counter more types of angel enemies, and actually respectable durability and support DPS.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

